# Scripted input for compose_window_input.kt's window (KLIO_WIN_INPUT): at
# the window's n-th event poll, an event as the platform would report it.
# Click into the text field.
3 move 50 20
3 press 50 20
3 release 50 20
# Type, erase one character, type more.
6 text hello
8 key 8
10 text ! klio
# Tab to the box, then Enter and Space on it (key codes are AWT's).
12 key 9
14 key 10 10
16 key 32 32
# Click the box.
18 move 50 60
18 press 50 60
18 release 50 60
# Escape (27): the window's onPreviewKeyEvent takes it. F1 (112): nothing in
# the content takes it, so the window's onKeyEvent hears it.
20 key 27 27
22 key 112
